ont-weight: bold;\">Windows and MacOS</span> you can install Linux in a virtual machine through VirtualBox. It's FOSS has a <a href=\"https://itsfoss.com/install-linux-in-virtualbox/\">guide</a> for doing it on Windows but most of the steps are the same on MacOS as well.\r\n\r\nWhen you have access to a Linux system you can download and execute the file called <code>elf</code> to get the flag.","services":[],"file_urls":["https://storage.ctfchall.se/challenges/8ae9bd08e93a47db3e572bdfab406d58558a81f24a45fbbd58a88848fbe4b84b/elf"],"title":"ELF 101","status":0},{"categories":["misc","medium"],"authors":["AndreasLonn"],"score":null,"order":73,"id":126,"unlocked_by":null,"unsolved_rating_count":0,"unsolved_rating_sum":0,"solved_rating_count":0,"solved_rating_sum":0,"solves":124,"eligible_solves":58,"top_solved_teams":[{"id":428,"name":"cptr0","time":1769200498},{"id":373,"name":"Kn\u00e4ck Koden Warriors","time":1769200514},{"id":355,"name":"Direftcati","time":1769200706}],"description":"Oh no! I accidentally aliased all my commands to `exit`! Can you help me get my flag back?","services":[{"user_display":"ncat --ssl alias-cmdexit.ctfchall.se 50000","hyperlink":false}],"file_urls":[],"title":"alias $cmd='exit #'","status":0},{"categories":["misc","medium"],"authors":["Movitz Sunar"],"score":null,"order":74,"id":143,"unlocked_by":null,"unsolved_rating_count":0,"unsolved_rating_sum":0,"solved_rating_count":0,"solved_rating_sum":0,"solves":88,"eligible_solves":52,"top_solved_teams":[{"id":380,"name":"DROP TABLE Flags;","time":1769203497},{"id":562,"name":"Statoil Pwn Team","time":1769203505},{"id":578,"name":"Quorra","time":1769203685}],"description":"we ofc block all bad prompts, do not prompt badly","services":[{"user_display":"https://svg-guard-bypass.ctfchall.se:50000","hyperlink":true}],"file_urls":["https://storage.ctfchall.se/challenges/cc5e2a7377a941177d964b86fab4ecae00ce51bd4011efda18ed5f277b6136f7/server.py"],"title":"SVG Guard Bypass","status":0},{"categories":[